{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_18b01288688348e4a16eabc7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t<!DOCTYPE html>\n2\t<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n3\t<head>\n4\t  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n5\t  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n6\t  <title>修仙自动化工厂 — Cultivation Factory</title>\n7\t  <style>\n8\t    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n9\t    body {\n10\t      background: #1a1a2e;\n11\t      color: #e0e0e0;\n12\t      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, monospace;\n13\t      overflow: hidden;\n14\t      height: 100vh;\n15\t      width: 100vw;\n16\t    }\n17\t    #app { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; }\n18\t\n19\t    /* Toolbar */\n20\t    #toolbar {\n21\t      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n22\t      padding: 6px 12px;\n23\t      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n24\t      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n25\t      min-height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0;\n26\t    }\n27\t    #toolbar h1 { font-size: 16px; color: #ffd700; margin-right: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }\n28\t    #toolbar .spacer { flex: 1; }\n29\t    .toolbar-btn {\n30\t      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n31\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n32\t      color: #e0e0e0; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px;\n33\t      cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; transition: background 0.2s;\n34\t    }\n35\t    .toolbar-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }\n36\t    .toolbar-btn.active { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); border-color: #6c6; }\n37\t\n38\t    /* Main layout */\n39\t    #main { display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }\n40\t\n41\t    /* Sidebar */\n42\t    #sidebar {\n43\t      width: 220px;\n44\t      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n45\t      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n46\t      overflow-y: auto; flex-shrink: 0;\n47\t      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n48\t    }\n49\t    .sidebar-section {\n50\t      padding: 8px;\n51\t      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n52\t    }\n53\t    .sidebar-section h3 {\n54\t      font-size: 12px; color: #aaa;\n55\t      margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase;\n56\t    }\n57\t    .building-item {\n58\t      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n59\t      padding: 6px 8px; margin: 2px 0; border-radius: 4px;\n60\t      cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; font-size: 12px;\n61\t    }\n62\t    .building-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n63\t    .building-item.selected { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.4); }\n64\t    .building-item .icon { font-size: 18px; }\n65\t    .building-item .info { flex: 1; }\n66\t    .building-item .name { color: #e0e0e0; }\n67\t    .building-item .cost { color: #888; font-size: 10px; }\n68\t    .building-item .cost.cannot { color: #c44; }\n69\t\n70\t    /* Canvas */\n71\t    #canvas-container { flex: 1; position: relative; }\n72\t    #gameCanvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n73\t\n74\t    /* Info panel */\n75\t    #info-panel {\n76\t      width: 240px;\n77\t      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n78\t      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n79\t      overflow-y: auto; flex-shrink: 0; padding: 8px;\n80\t      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n81\t    }\n82\t    #info-panel h3 { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n83\t    .info-entry { font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 0; color: #ccc; }\n84\t\n85\t    /* Realm panel */\n86\t    .realm-panel {\n87\t      background: rgba(255,215,0,0.05);\n88\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);\n89\t      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n90\t    }\n91\t    .realm-panel .realm-name {\n92\t      color: #ffd700; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\n93\t    }\n94\t    .realm-panel .realm-exp-bar {\n95\t      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n96\t      border-radius: 3px; height: 14px;\n97\t      margin: 4px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n98\t    }\n99\t    .realm-panel .realm-exp-fill {\n100\t      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ffaa00);\n101\t      height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s;\n102\t    }\n103\t    .realm-panel .realm-exp-text {\n104\t      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n105\t      font-size: 9px; color: #fff; line-height: 14px;\n106\t    }\n107\t    .breakthrough-btn {\n108\t      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ff8c00);\n109\t      border: none; color: #1a1a2e; font-weight: bold;\n110\t      padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\n111\t      font-size: 12px; width: 100%; margin-top: 4px;\n112\t      transition: opacity 0.2s;\n113\t    }\n114\t    .breakthrough-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }\n115\t    .breakthrough-btn:disabled {\n116\t      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #666;\n117\t      cursor: not-allowed;\n118\t    }\n119\t    .breakthrough-req {\n120\t      font-size: 10px; color: #888; padding: 2px 0;\n121\t    }\n122\t    .breakthrough-req.met { color: #6c6; }\n123\t    .breakthrough-req.unmet { color: #c44; }\n124\t\n125\t    /* Inventory panel */\n126\t    .inventory-panel {\n127\t      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n128\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n129\t      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n130\t    }\n131\t    .pill-item {\n132\t      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n133\t      padding: 4px 0; font-size: 11px;\n134\t    }\n135\t    .pill-item .pill-name { flex: 1; }\n136\t    .pill-item .pill-count { color: #aaa; }\n137\t    .pill-use-btn {\n138\t      background: rgba(100,200,100,0.2);\n139\t      border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.3);\n140\t      color: #6c6; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px;\n141\t      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n142\t    }\n143\t    .pill-use-btn:hover { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); }\n144\t    .pill-use-all-btn {\n145\t      background: rgba(255,200,50,0.2);\n146\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,200,50,0.3);\n147\t      color: #ffd700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px;\n148\t      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n149\t    }\n150\t\n151\t    /* Alchemy panel */\n152\t    .alchemy-panel {\n153\t      background: rgba(255,140,50,0.05);\n154\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,50,0.2);\n155\t      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n156\t    }\n157\t    .recipe-item {\n158\t      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n159\t      padding: 4px 0; font-size: 11px;\n160\t    }\n161\t    .recipe-item .recipe-name { flex: 1; }\n162\t    .recipe-craft-btn {\n163\t      background: rgba(255,140,50,0.2);\n164\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,50,0.3);\n165\t      color: #ff8c32; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px;\n166\t      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n167\t    }\n168\t    .recipe-craft-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,140,50,0.3); }\n169\t    .recipe-craft-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }\n170\t    .alchemy-progress {\n171\t      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n172\t      border-radius: 3px; height: 12px;\n173\t      margin: 4px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n174\t    }\n175\t    .alchemy-progress-fill {\n176\t      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8c32, #ffaa00);\n177\t      height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s;\n178\t    }\n179\t    .alchemy-progress-text {\n180\t      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n181\t      font-size: 9px; color: #fff; line-height: 12px;\n182\t    }\n183\t    .alchemy-collect-btn {\n184\t      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8c32, #ffaa00);\n185\t      border: none; color: #1a1a2e; font-weight: bold;\n186\t      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer;\n187\t      font-size: 11px; width: 100%;\n188\t    }\n189\t\n190\t    /* Notifications */\n191\t    #notifications {\n192\t      position: absolute; top: 56px; right: 12px;\n193\t      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n194\t      pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;\n195\t    }\n196\t    .notif {\n197\t      padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px;\n198\t      font-size: 11px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;\n199\t      pointer-events: auto;\n200\t    }\n201\t    .notif.show { opacity: 1; }\n202\t    .notif.info { background: rgba(100,100,255,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(100,100,255,0.5); }\n203\t    .notif.success { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.5); }\n204\t    .notif.warning { background: rgba(255,200,50,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,200,50,0.5); }\n205\t    .notif.error { background: rgba(200,100,100,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,100,0.5); }\n206\t\n207\t    /* Status bar */\n208\t    #statusbar {\n209\t      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n210\t      padding: 4px 12px;\n211\t      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n212\t      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n213\t      font-size: 11px; color: #888;\n214\t      min-height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;\n215\t    }\n216\t    #statusbar .fps { color: #6a6; }\n217\t\n218\t    #placement-hint {\n219\t      position: absolute; bottom: 40px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n220\t      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); color: #ffd700;\n221\t      padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;\n222\t      pointer-events: none; display: none;\n223\t    }\n224\t\n225\t    /* Scrollbar */\n226\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }\n227\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n228\t    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 3px; }\n229\t\n230\t    /* Tab buttons for info panel */\n231\t    .tab-bar {\n232\t      display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;\n233\t    }\n234\t    .tab-btn {\n235\t      flex: 1; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n236\t      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n237\t      color: #888; padding: 4px 0; border-radius: 3px;\n238\t      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px; text-align: center;\n239\t    }\n240\t    .tab-btn.active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #e0e0e0; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n241\t    .tab-content { display: none; }\n242\t    .tab-content.active { display: block; }\n243\t  </style>\n244\t</head>\n245\t<body>\n246\t  <div id=\"app\">\n247\t    <div id=\"toolbar\">\n248\t      <h1>⛰ 修仙工厂</h1>\n249\t      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n250\t      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-audio\" title=\"音效开关\">🔊</button>\n251\t      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-save\" title=\"保存游戏\">💾 保存</button>\n252\t      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-center\" title=\"居中视角\">◎ 居中</button>\n253\t      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-reset\" title=\"重置游戏\">⚠ 重置</button>\n254\t    </div>\n255\t    <div id=\"main\">\n256\t      <div id=\"sidebar\">\n257\t        <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n258\t          <h3>🏗 建筑设施</h3>\n259\t          <div id=\"building-list\"></div>\n260\t        </div>\n261\t        <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n262\t          <h3>🔬 炼丹配方</h3>\n263\t          <div id=\"recipe-list\"></div>\n264\t        </div>\n265\t      </div>\n266\t      <div id=\"canvas-container\">\n267\t        <canvas id=\"gameCanvas\"></canvas>\n268\t        <div id=\"placement-hint\">点击地图放置建筑 | ESC 取消</div>\n269\t        <div id=\"notifications\"></div>\n270\t      </div>\n271\t      <div id=\"info-panel\">\n272\t        <!-- Realm panel -->\n273\t        <div class=\"realm-panel\" id=\"realm-panel\">\n274\t          <div class=\"realm-name\" id=\"realm-name\">凡人</div>\n275\t          <div class=\"realm-exp-bar\">\n276\t            <div class=\"realm-exp-fill\" id=\"realm-exp-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n277\t            <div class=\"realm-exp-text\" id=\"realm-exp-text\">0%</div>\n278\t          </div>\n279\t          <div id=\"breakthrough-reqs\"></div>\n280\t          <button class=\"breakthrough-btn\" id=\"btn-breakthrough\" disabled>境界突破</button>\n281\t        </div>\n282\t\n283\t        <!-- Tab bar -->\n284\t        <div class=\"tab-bar\">\n285\t          <button class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"inventory\">🎒 丹药</button>\n286\t          <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"info\">📊 信息</button>\n287\t          <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"alchemy\">🔥 炼丹</button>\n288\t        </div>\n289\t\n290\t        <!-- Inventory tab -->\n291\t        <div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-inventory\">\n292\t          <div class=\"inventory-panel\">\n293\t            <h3>💊 丹药背包</h3>\n294\t            <div id=\"pill-list\"><div class=\"info-entry\">暂无丹药</div></div>\n295\t          </div>\n296\t        </div>\n297\t\n298\t        <!-- Info tab -->\n299\t        <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-info\">\n300\t          <div id=\"building-info\"><div class=\"info-entry\">点击建筑查看详情</div></div>\n301\t        </div>\n302\t\n303\t        <!-- Alchemy tab -->\n304\t        <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-alchemy\">\n305\t          <div class=\"alchemy-panel\">\n306\t            <h3>🔥 炼丹进度</h3>\n307\t            <div id=\"alchemy-status\">\n308\t              <div class=\"info-entry\">选择配方开始炼丹</div>\n309\t            </div>\n310\t          </div>\n311\t        </div>\n312\t      </div>\n313\t    </div>\n314\t    <div id=\"statusbar\">\n315\t      <span class=\"fps\" id=\"fps-display\">FPS: --</span>\n316\t      <span id=\"status-text\">就绪</span>\n317\t      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n318\t      <span id=\"playtime\">游玩时间: 0:00</span>\n319\t    </div>\n320\t  </div>\n321\t\n322\t  <script type=\"module\">\n323\t    import { App } from './src/renderer/App.ts';\n324\t\n325\t    const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');\n326\t    const app = new App(canvas);\n327\t    app.centerCamera();\n328\t\n329\t    // FPS counter\n330\t    let frameCount = 0;\n331\t    let fpsTime = performance.now();\n332\t    const fpsDisplay = document.getElementById('fps-display');\n333\t    const statusText = document.getElementById('status-text');\n334\t    const playtimeDisplay = document.getElementById('playtime');\n335\t\n336\t    setInterval(() => {\n337\t      const now = performance.now();\n338\t      const fps = Math.round(frameCount * 1000 / (now - fpsTime));\n339\t      fpsDisplay.textContent = `FPS: ${fps}`;\n340\t      frameCount = 0;\n341\t      fpsTime = now;\n342\t\n343\t      const secs = Math.floor(app.state.totalPlaytime);\n344\t      const mins = Math.floor(secs / 60);\n345\t      const hrs = Math.floor(mins / 60);\n346\t      playtimeDisplay.textContent = `游玩时间: ${hrs}:${String(mins % 60).padStart(2, '0')}`;\n347\t    }, 1000);\n348\t\n349\t    const origLoop = app.loop.bind(app);\n350\t    app.loop = (now) => { frameCount++; origLoop(now); };\n351\t    app.start();\n352\t\n353\t    // === Notifications ===\n354\t    const notifContainer = document.getElementById('notifications');\n355\t    app.onNotification = (notif) => {\n356\t      const el = document.createElement('div');\n357\t      el.className = `notif ${notif.type}`;\n358\t      el.textContent = notif.text;\n359\t      notifContainer.appendChild(el);\n360\t      requestAnimationFrame(() => el.classList.add('show'));\n361\t      setTimeout(() => {\n362\t        el.classList.remove('show');\n363\t        setTimeout(() => el.remove(), 300);\n364\t      }, 3000);\n365\t    };\n366\t\n367\t    // === Tabs ===\n368\t    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {\n369\t      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n370\t        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n371\t        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));\n372\t        btn.classList.add('active');\n373\t        document.getElementById(`tab-${btn.dataset.tab}`).classList.add('active');\n374\t      });\n375\t    });\n376\t\n377\t    // === Building sidebar ===\n378\t    const buildingList = document.getElementById('building-list');\n379\t    const placementHint = document.getElementById('placement-hint');\n380\t\n381\t    function renderBuildingList() {\n382\t      buildingList.innerHTML = '';\n383\t      const available = app.getAvailableBuildings();\n384\t      for (const def of available) {\n385\t        const item = document.createElement('div');\n386\t        item.className = 'building-item';\n387\t        if (app.placementMode?.id === def.id) item.classList.add('selected');\n388\t\n389\t        const affordable = !Object.keys(def.cost).length ||\n390\t          Object.entries(def.cost).every(([r, c]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= c);\n391\t\n392\t        const icon = getIcon(def.category);\n393\t        const costStr = Object.entries(def.cost).length > 0\n394\t          ? Object.entries(def.cost).map(([r, c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ')\n395\t          : '免费';\n396\t\n397\t        item.innerHTML = `\n398\t          <span class=\"icon\">${icon}</span>\n399\t          <div class=\"info\">\n400\t            <div class=\"name\">${def.name}</div>\n401\t            <div class=\"cost ${affordable ? '' : 'cannot'}\">${costStr}</div>\n402\t          </div>\n403\t        `;\n404\t\n405\t        item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n406\t          if (app.placementMode?.id === def.id) {\n407\t            app.placementMode = null;\n408\t            placementHint.style.display = 'none';\n409\t            statusText.textContent = '就绪';\n410\t          } else {\n411\t            app.placementMode = def;\n412\t            placementHint.style.display = 'block';\n413\t            statusText.textContent = `放置模式: ${def.name}`;\n414\t          }\n415\t          renderBuildingList();\n416\t        });\n417\t\n418\t        buildingList.appendChild(item);\n419\t      }\n420\t    }\n421\t\n422\t    function getIcon(category) {\n423\t      const icons = { mining: '⛏', farming: '🌿', alchemy: '🔥', energy: '✨', cultivation: '🧘' };\n424\t      return icons[category] || '🏠';\n425\t    }\n426\t\n427\t    function getResourceName(id) {\n428\t      const names = {\n429\t        spirit_stone: '灵石', spirit_grass: '灵草', spirit_energy: '灵气',\n430\t        cultivation: '修为', pill_juling: '聚灵丹', pill_peiyuan: '培元丹',\n431\t        pill_ningqi: '凝气丹', spirit_iron: '灵铁',\n432\t      };\n433\t      return names[id] ?? id;\n434\t    }\n435\t\n436\t    renderBuildingList();\n437\t\n438\t    // === Recipe sidebar ===\n439\t    function renderRecipeList() {\n440\t      const recipeList = document.getElementById('recipe-list');\n441\t      recipeList.innerHTML = '';\n442\t      const recipes = app.getAvailableAlchemyRecipes();\n443\t      for (const recipe of recipes) {\n444\t        const item = document.createElement('div');\n445\t        item.className = 'recipe-item';\n446\t\n447\t        const ingredients = Object.entries(recipe.ingredients)\n448\t          .map(([r, c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ');\n449\t        const canCraftNow = app.state.alchemySession === null &&\n450\t          Object.entries(recipe.ingredients).every(([r, c]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= c);\n451\t\n452\t        item.innerHTML = `\n453\t          <span style=\"color:${recipe.output.resource === 'pill_juling' ? '#ff8c32' : recipe.output.resource === 'pill_peiyuan' ? '#ff6699' : '#cc66ff'}\">💊</span>\n454\t          <span class=\"recipe-name\">${recipe.name}</span>\n455\t          <button class=\"recipe-craft-btn\" ${canCraftNow ? '' : 'disabled'}>${ingredients}</button>\n456\t        `;\n457\t\n458\t        item.querySelector('.recipe-craft-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n459\t          app.startAlchemyAction(recipe.id);\n460\t        });\n461\t\n462\t        recipeList.appendChild(item);\n463\t      }\n464\t    }\n465\t\n466\t    // === Realm panel ===\n467\t    function renderRealmPanel() {\n468\t      const c = app.state.cultivation;\n469\t      const nameEl = document.getElementById('realm-name');\n470\t      const fillEl = document.getElementById('realm-exp-fill');\n471\t      const textEl = document.getElementById('realm-exp-text');\n472\t      const reqsEl = document.getElementById('breakthrough-reqs');\n473\t      const btnEl = document.getElementById('btn-breakthrough');\n474\t\n475\t      // Import getFullRealmName\n476\t      import('./src/game/Cultivation.ts').then(({ getFullRealmName, canBreakthrough, getBreakthroughRequirements, getSubStageName }) => {\n477\t        nameEl.textContent = getFullRealmName(c);\n478\t        const ratio = c.exp / c.expToNext;\n479\t        fillEl.style.width = `${Math.floor(ratio * 100)}%`;\n480\t        textEl.textContent = `${Math.floor(ratio * 100)}%`;\n481\t\n482\t        const reqs = getBreakthroughRequirements(c);\n483\t        reqsEl.innerHTML = '';\n484\t\n485\t        if (reqs.canAttempt || c.level >= 3) {\n486\t          // Show breakthrough requirements\n487\t          for (const [res, amount] of Object.entries(reqs.resourceCost)) {\n488\t            const current = app.state.resources[res] ?? 0;\n489\t            const met = current >= amount;\n490\t            reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req ${met ? 'met' : 'unmet'}\">${met ? '✓' : '✗'} ${getResourceName(res)}: ${current}/${amount}</div>`;\n491\t          }\n492\t          if (reqs.needsPill && reqs.pillId) {\n493\t            const current = app.state.resources[reqs.pillId] ?? 0;\n494\t            const met = current >= reqs.pillCount;\n495\t            reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req ${met ? 'met' : 'unmet'}\">${met ? '✓' : '✗'} ${getResourceName(reqs.pillId)}: ${current}/${reqs.pillCount}</div>`;\n496\t          }\n497\t          reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req\" style=\"color:#aaa\">成功率: ${Math.floor(reqs.successRate * 100)}%</div>`;\n498\t\n499\t          const canAttempt = reqs.canAttempt &&\n500\t            Object.entries(reqs.resourceCost).every(([r, a]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= a) &&\n501\t            (!reqs.needsPill || (app.state.resources[reqs.pillId ?? ''] ?? 0) >= (reqs.pillCount ?? 0));\n502\t\n503\t          btnEl.disabled = !canAttempt;\n504\t        } else {\n505\t          reqsEl.innerHTML = `<div class=\"breakthrough-req\" style=\"color:#888\">修为满级后可突破</div>`;\n506\t          btnEl.disabled = true;\n507\t        }\n508\t      });\n509\t    }\n510\t\n511\t    // === Inventory panel ===\n512\t    function renderInventory() {\n513\t      const pillList = document.getElementById('pill-list');\n514\t      const pills = app.getInventoryPills();\n515\t\n516\t      if (pills.length === 0) {\n517\t        pillList.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#888\">暂无丹药</div>';\n518\t        return;\n519\t      }\n520\t\n521\t      pillList.innerHTML = '';\n522\t      for (const pill of pills) {\n523\t        const item = document.createElement('div');\n524\t        item.className = 'pill-item';\n525\t        item.innerHTML = `\n526\t          <span style=\"color:${pill.color}\">💊</span>\n527\t          <span class=\"pill-name\">${pill.name}</span>\n528\t          <span class=\"pill-count\">×${pill.count}</span>\n529\t          <button class=\"pill-use-btn\" data-id=\"${pill.id}\">服用</button>\n530\t          ${pill.count > 1 ? `<button class=\"pill-use-all-btn\" data-id=\"${pill.id}\">全部</button>` : ''}\n531\t        `;\n532\t        pillList.appendChild(item);\n533\t      }\n534\t\n535\t      // Bind pill use buttons\n536\t      pillList.querySelectorAll('.pill-use-btn').forEach(btn => {\n537\t        btn.addEventListener('click', () => app.usePillAction(btn.dataset.id));\n538\t      });\n539\t      pillList.querySelectorAll('.pill-use-all-btn').forEach(btn => {\n540\t        btn.addEventListener('click', () => app.useAllPills(btn.dataset.id));\n541\t      });\n542\t    }\n543\t\n544\t    // === Alchemy status ===\n545\t    function renderAlchemyStatus() {\n546\t      const statusEl = document.getElementById('alchemy-status');\n547\t      const session = app.state.alchemySession;\n548\t\n549\t      if (!session) {\n550\t        statusEl.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\">选择配方开始炼丹</div>';\n551\t        return;\n552\t      }\n553\t\n554\t      const progress = Math.floor(session.progress * 100);\n555\t      statusEl.innerHTML = `\n556\t        <div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#ff8c32\">${session.recipeId === 'pill_juling' ? '聚灵丹' : session.recipeId === 'pill_peiyuan' ? '培元丹' : '凝气丹'}</div>\n557\t        <div class=\"alchemy-progress\">\n558\t          <div class=\"alchemy-progress-fill\" style=\"width:${progress}%\"></div>\n559\t          <div class=\"alchemy-progress-text\">${progress}%</div>\n560\t        </div>\n561\t        ${session.complete ? '<button class=\"alchemy-collect-btn\" id=\"btn-collect-alchemy\">收取丹药</button>' : ''}\n562\t      `;\n563\t\n564\t      const collectBtn = document.getElementById('btn-collect-alchemy');\n565\t      if (collectBtn) {\n566\t        collectBtn.addEventListener('click', () => app.collectAlchemyAction());\n567\t      }\n568\t    }\n569\t\n570\t    // === Building info ===\n571\t    function updateBuildingInfo(building) {\n572\t      const infoDiv = document.getElementById('building-info');\n573\t      if (!building) {\n574\t        infoDiv.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\">点击建筑查看详情</div>';\n575\t        return;\n576\t      }\n577\t      const def = app.buildingDefs.get(building.buildingId);\n578\t      if (!def) return;\n579\t      const prod = def.production;\n580\t      infoDiv.innerHTML = `\n581\t        <div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#ffd700;font-weight:bold\">${def.name}</div>\n582\t        <div class=\"info-entry\">等级: ${building.level}/${def.maxLevel}</div>\n583\t        <div class=\"info-entry\">类型: ${prod.mode === 'manual' ? '手动' : '自动'}</div>\n584\t        <div class=\"info-entry\">产出: ${getResourceName(prod.resource)} ×${prod.amount}</div>\n585\t        ${prod.interval > 0 ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">间隔: ${(prod.interval / 1000).toFixed(1)}s</div>` : ''}\n586\t        ${prod.input ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">消耗: ${Object.entries(prod.input).map(([r,c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ')}</div>` : ''}\n587\t        <div class=\"info-entry\">状态: ${building.isProducing ? '生产中' : '空闲'}</div>\n588\t        ${building.progress > 0 ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">进度: ${Math.floor(building.progress * 100)}%</div>` : ''}\n589\t      `;\n590\t    }\n591\t\n592\t    // === State change handler ===\n593\t    app.onStateChange = (state) => {\n594\t      renderBuildingList();\n595\t      renderRecipeList();\n596\t      renderRealmPanel();\n597\t      renderInventory();\n598\t      renderAlchemyStatus();\n599\t    };\n600\t\n601\t    app.onBuildingSelect = (building) => {\n602\t      // Switch to info tab\n603\t      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n604\t      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));\n605\t      document.querySelector('[data-tab=\"info\"]').classList.add('active');\n606\t      document.getElementById('tab-info').classList.add('active');\n607\t      updateBuildingInfo(building);\n608\t    };\n609\t\n610\t    app.onAlchemyUpdate = (session) => {\n611\t      renderAlchemyStatus();\n612\t    };\n613\t\n614\t    // === Breakthrough ===\n615\t    document.getElementById('btn-breakthrough').addEventListener('click', () => {\n616\t      app.attemptBreakthroughAction();\n617\t    });\n618\t\n619\t    // === Toolbar buttons ===\n620\t    document.getElementById('btn-save').addEventListener('click', () => {\n621\t      import('./src/game/GameState.ts').then(({ saveGame }) => {\n622\t        saveGame(app.state);\n623\t        app.addNotification('游戏已保存', 'info');\n624\t      });\n625\t    });\n626\t\n627\t    document.getElementById('btn-center').addEventListener('click', () => {\n628\t      app.centerCamera();\n629\t    });\n630\t\n631\t    document.getElementById('btn-reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n632\t      if (confirm('确定要重置游戏进度吗？此操作不可撤销！')) {\n633\t        import('./src/game/GameState.ts').then(({ clearSave }) => {\n634\t          clearSave();\n635\t          location.reload();\n636\t        });\n637\t      }\n638\t    });\n639\t\n640\t    // Audio toggle\n641\t    import('./src/game/AudioManager.ts').then(({ audioManager }) => {\n642\t      const audioBtn = document.getElementById('btn-audio');\n643\t      audioBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n644\t        audioManager.init();\n645\t        const muted = audioManager.toggleMute();\n646\t        audioBtn.textContent = muted ? '🔇' : '🔊';\n647\t      });\n648\t    });\n649\t\n650\t    // Initial render\n651\t    renderRealmPanel();\n652\t    renderInventory();\n653\t    renderAlchemyStatus();\n654\t    renderRecipeList();\n655\t  </script>\n656\t</body>\n657\t</html>\n658\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0e01ba0-5708-46af-9590-e43af2395006","uuid":"177927f0-3870-443c-bcbb-006d81cb52a1","timestamp":"2026-05-23T01:35:20.898Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\steam-cultivation-factory\\index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>修仙自动化工厂 — Cultivation Factory</title>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      background: #1a1a2e;\n      color: #e0e0e0;\n      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, monospace;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      height: 100vh;\n      width: 100vw;\n    }\n    #app { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; }\n\n    /* Toolbar */\n    #toolbar {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n      padding: 6px 12px;\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      min-height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    #toolbar h1 { font-size: 16px; color: #ffd700; margin-right: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }\n    #toolbar .spacer { flex: 1; }\n    .toolbar-btn {\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n      color: #e0e0e0; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px;\n      cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; transition: background 0.2s;\n    }\n    .toolbar-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }\n    .toolbar-btn.active { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); border-color: #6c6; }\n\n    /* Main layout */\n    #main { display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }\n\n    /* Sidebar */\n    #sidebar {\n      width: 220px;\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      overflow-y: auto; flex-shrink: 0;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .sidebar-section {\n      padding: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    }\n    .sidebar-section h3 {\n      font-size: 12px; color: #aaa;\n      margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .building-item {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n      padding: 6px 8px; margin: 2px 0; border-radius: 4px;\n      cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .building-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n    .building-item.selected { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.4); }\n    .building-item .icon { font-size: 18px; }\n    .building-item .info { flex: 1; }\n    .building-item .name { color: #e0e0e0; }\n    .building-item .cost { color: #888; font-size: 10px; }\n    .building-item .cost.cannot { color: #c44; }\n\n    /* Canvas */\n    #canvas-container { flex: 1; position: relative; }\n    #gameCanvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n\n    /* Info panel */\n    #info-panel {\n      width: 240px;\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      overflow-y: auto; flex-shrink: 0; padding: 8px;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n    }\n    #info-panel h3 { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n    .info-entry { font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 0; color: #ccc; }\n\n    /* Realm panel */\n    .realm-panel {\n      background: rgba(255,215,0,0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.2);\n      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n    }\n    .realm-panel .realm-name {\n      color: #ffd700; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .realm-panel .realm-exp-bar {\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      border-radius: 3px; height: 14px;\n      margin: 4px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .realm-panel .realm-exp-fill {\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ffaa00);\n      height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s;\n    }\n    .realm-panel .realm-exp-text {\n      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n      font-size: 9px; color: #fff; line-height: 14px;\n    }\n    .breakthrough-btn {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ff8c00);\n      border: none; color: #1a1a2e; font-weight: bold;\n      padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 12px; width: 100%; margin-top: 4px;\n      transition: opacity 0.2s;\n    }\n    .breakthrough-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }\n    .breakthrough-btn:disabled {\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #666;\n      cursor: not-allowed;\n    }\n    .breakthrough-req {\n      font-size: 10px; color: #888; padding: 2px 0;\n    }\n    .breakthrough-req.met { color: #6c6; }\n    .breakthrough-req.unmet { color: #c44; }\n\n    /* Inventory panel */\n    .inventory-panel {\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n    }\n    .pill-item {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n      padding: 4px 0; font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .pill-item .pill-name { flex: 1; }\n    .pill-item .pill-count { color: #aaa; }\n    .pill-use-btn {\n      background: rgba(100,200,100,0.2);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.3);\n      color: #6c6; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px;\n      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n    }\n    .pill-use-btn:hover { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); }\n    .pill-use-all-btn {\n      background: rgba(255,200,50,0.2);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,200,50,0.3);\n      color: #ffd700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px;\n      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    /* Alchemy panel */\n    .alchemy-panel {\n      background: rgba(255,140,50,0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,50,0.2);\n      border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px;\n    }\n    .recipe-item {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n      padding: 4px 0; font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .recipe-item .recipe-name { flex: 1; }\n    .recipe-craft-btn {\n      background: rgba(255,140,50,0.2);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,140,50,0.3);\n      color: #ff8c32; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px;\n      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px;\n    }\n    .recipe-craft-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,140,50,0.3); }\n    .recipe-craft-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .alchemy-progress {\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      border-radius: 3px; height: 12px;\n      margin: 4px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .alchemy-progress-fill {\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8c32, #ffaa00);\n      height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s;\n    }\n    .alchemy-progress-text {\n      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n      font-size: 9px; color: #fff; line-height: 12px;\n    }\n    .alchemy-collect-btn {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8c32, #ffaa00);\n      border: none; color: #1a1a2e; font-weight: bold;\n      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 11px; width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    /* Notifications */\n    #notifications {\n      position: absolute; top: 56px; right: 12px;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n      pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;\n    }\n    .notif {\n      padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px;\n      font-size: 11px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n    .notif.show { opacity: 1; }\n    .notif.info { background: rgba(100,100,255,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(100,100,255,0.5); }\n    .notif.success { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(100,200,100,0.5); }\n    .notif.warning { background: rgba(255,200,50,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,200,50,0.5); }\n    .notif.error { background: rgba(200,100,100,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,100,0.5); }\n\n    /* Status bar */\n    #statusbar {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n      padding: 4px 12px;\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      font-size: 11px; color: #888;\n      min-height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    #statusbar .fps { color: #6a6; }\n\n    #placement-hint {\n      position: absolute; bottom: 40px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); color: #ffd700;\n      padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;\n      pointer-events: none; display: none;\n    }\n\n    /* Scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 3px; }\n\n    /* Tab buttons for info panel */\n    .tab-bar {\n      display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    .tab-btn {\n      flex: 1; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      color: #888; padding: 4px 0; border-radius: 3px;\n      cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px; text-align: center;\n    }\n    .tab-btn.active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #e0e0e0; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n    .tab-content { display: none; }\n    .tab-content.active { display: block; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\">\n    <div id=\"toolbar\">\n      <h1>⛰ 修仙工厂</h1>\n      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-audio\" title=\"音效开关\">🔊</button>\n      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-save\" title=\"保存游戏\">💾 保存</button>\n      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-center\" title=\"居中视角\">◎ 居中</button>\n      <button class=\"toolbar-btn\" id=\"btn-reset\" title=\"重置游戏\">⚠ 重置</button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"main\">\n      <div id=\"sidebar\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n          <h3>🏗 建筑设施</h3>\n          <div id=\"building-list\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n          <h3>🔬 炼丹配方</h3>\n          <div id=\"recipe-list\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"canvas-container\">\n        <canvas id=\"gameCanvas\"></canvas>\n        <div id=\"placement-hint\">点击地图放置建筑 | ESC 取消</div>\n        <div id=\"notifications\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"info-panel\">\n        <!-- Realm panel -->\n        <div class=\"realm-panel\" id=\"realm-panel\">\n          <div class=\"realm-name\" id=\"realm-name\">凡人</div>\n          <div class=\"realm-exp-bar\">\n            <div class=\"realm-exp-fill\" id=\"realm-exp-fill\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"realm-exp-text\" id=\"realm-exp-text\">0%</div>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"breakthrough-reqs\"></div>\n          <button class=\"breakthrough-btn\" id=\"btn-breakthrough\" disabled>境界突破</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Tab bar -->\n        <div class=\"tab-bar\">\n          <button class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"inventory\">🎒 丹药</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"info\">📊 信息</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"alchemy\">🔥 炼丹</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Inventory tab -->\n        <div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-inventory\">\n          <div class=\"inventory-panel\">\n            <h3>💊 丹药背包</h3>\n            <div id=\"pill-list\"><div class=\"info-entry\">暂无丹药</div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Info tab -->\n        <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-info\">\n          <div id=\"building-info\"><div class=\"info-entry\">点击建筑查看详情</div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Alchemy tab -->\n        <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-alchemy\">\n          <div class=\"alchemy-panel\">\n            <h3>🔥 炼丹进度</h3>\n            <div id=\"alchemy-status\">\n              <div class=\"info-entry\">选择配方开始炼丹</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"statusbar\">\n      <span class=\"fps\" id=\"fps-display\">FPS: --</span>\n      <span id=\"status-text\">就绪</span>\n      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n      <span id=\"playtime\">游玩时间: 0:00</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script type=\"module\">\n    import { App } from './src/renderer/App.ts';\n\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');\n    const app = new App(canvas);\n    app.centerCamera();\n\n    // FPS counter\n    let frameCount = 0;\n    let fpsTime = performance.now();\n    const fpsDisplay = document.getElementById('fps-display');\n    const statusText = document.getElementById('status-text');\n    const playtimeDisplay = document.getElementById('playtime');\n\n    setInterval(() => {\n      const now = performance.now();\n      const fps = Math.round(frameCount * 1000 / (now - fpsTime));\n      fpsDisplay.textContent = `FPS: ${fps}`;\n      frameCount = 0;\n      fpsTime = now;\n\n      const secs = Math.floor(app.state.totalPlaytime);\n      const mins = Math.floor(secs / 60);\n      const hrs = Math.floor(mins / 60);\n      playtimeDisplay.textContent = `游玩时间: ${hrs}:${String(mins % 60).padStart(2, '0')}`;\n    }, 1000);\n\n    const origLoop = app.loop.bind(app);\n    app.loop = (now) => { frameCount++; origLoop(now); };\n    app.start();\n\n    // === Notifications ===\n    const notifContainer = document.getElementById('notifications');\n    app.onNotification = (notif) => {\n      const el = document.createElement('div');\n      el.className = `notif ${notif.type}`;\n      el.textContent = notif.text;\n      notifContainer.appendChild(el);\n      requestAnimationFrame(() => el.classList.add('show'));\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        el.classList.remove('show');\n        setTimeout(() => el.remove(), 300);\n      }, 3000);\n    };\n\n    // === Tabs ===\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));\n        btn.classList.add('active');\n        document.getElementById(`tab-${btn.dataset.tab}`).classList.add('active');\n      });\n    });\n\n    // === Building sidebar ===\n    const buildingList = document.getElementById('building-list');\n    const placementHint = document.getElementById('placement-hint');\n\n    function renderBuildingList() {\n      buildingList.innerHTML = '';\n      const available = app.getAvailableBuildings();\n      for (const def of available) {\n        const item = document.createElement('div');\n        item.className = 'building-item';\n        if (app.placementMode?.id === def.id) item.classList.add('selected');\n\n        const affordable = !Object.keys(def.cost).length ||\n          Object.entries(def.cost).every(([r, c]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= c);\n\n        const icon = getIcon(def.category);\n        const costStr = Object.entries(def.cost).length > 0\n          ? Object.entries(def.cost).map(([r, c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ')\n          : '免费';\n\n        item.innerHTML = `\n          <span class=\"icon\">${icon}</span>\n          <div class=\"info\">\n            <div class=\"name\">${def.name}</div>\n            <div class=\"cost ${affordable ? '' : 'cannot'}\">${costStr}</div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n\n        item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n          if (app.placementMode?.id === def.id) {\n            app.placementMode = null;\n            placementHint.style.display = 'none';\n            statusText.textContent = '就绪';\n          } else {\n            app.placementMode = def;\n            placementHint.style.display = 'block';\n            statusText.textContent = `放置模式: ${def.name}`;\n          }\n          renderBuildingList();\n        });\n\n        buildingList.appendChild(item);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function getIcon(category) {\n      const icons = { mining: '⛏', farming: '🌿', alchemy: '🔥', energy: '✨', cultivation: '🧘' };\n      return icons[category] || '🏠';\n    }\n\n    function getResourceName(id) {\n      const names = {\n        spirit_stone: '灵石', spirit_grass: '灵草', spirit_energy: '灵气',\n        cultivation: '修为', pill_juling: '聚灵丹', pill_peiyuan: '培元丹',\n        pill_ningqi: '凝气丹', spirit_iron: '灵铁',\n      };\n      return names[id] ?? id;\n    }\n\n    renderBuildingList();\n\n    // === Recipe sidebar ===\n    function renderRecipeList() {\n      const recipeList = document.getElementById('recipe-list');\n      recipeList.innerHTML = '';\n      const recipes = app.getAvailableAlchemyRecipes();\n      for (const recipe of recipes) {\n        const item = document.createElement('div');\n        item.className = 'recipe-item';\n\n        const ingredients = Object.entries(recipe.ingredients)\n          .map(([r, c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ');\n        const canCraftNow = app.state.alchemySession === null &&\n          Object.entries(recipe.ingredients).every(([r, c]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= c);\n\n        item.innerHTML = `\n          <span style=\"color:${recipe.output.resource === 'pill_juling' ? '#ff8c32' : recipe.output.resource === 'pill_peiyuan' ? '#ff6699' : '#cc66ff'}\">💊</span>\n          <span class=\"recipe-name\">${recipe.name}</span>\n          <button class=\"recipe-craft-btn\" ${canCraftNow ? '' : 'disabled'}>${ingredients}</button>\n        `;\n\n        item.querySelector('.recipe-craft-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n          app.startAlchemyAction(recipe.id);\n        });\n\n        recipeList.appendChild(item);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // === Realm panel ===\n    function renderRealmPanel() {\n      const c = app.state.cultivation;\n      const nameEl = document.getElementById('realm-name');\n      const fillEl = document.getElementById('realm-exp-fill');\n      const textEl = document.getElementById('realm-exp-text');\n      const reqsEl = document.getElementById('breakthrough-reqs');\n      const btnEl = document.getElementById('btn-breakthrough');\n\n      // Import getFullRealmName\n      import('./src/game/Cultivation.ts').then(({ getFullRealmName, canBreakthrough, getBreakthroughRequirements, getSubStageName }) => {\n        nameEl.textContent = getFullRealmName(c);\n        const ratio = c.exp / c.expToNext;\n        fillEl.style.width = `${Math.floor(ratio * 100)}%`;\n        textEl.textContent = `${Math.floor(ratio * 100)}%`;\n\n        const reqs = getBreakthroughRequirements(c);\n        reqsEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n        if (reqs.canAttempt || c.level >= 3) {\n          // Show breakthrough requirements\n          for (const [res, amount] of Object.entries(reqs.resourceCost)) {\n            const current = app.state.resources[res] ?? 0;\n            const met = current >= amount;\n            reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req ${met ? 'met' : 'unmet'}\">${met ? '✓' : '✗'} ${getResourceName(res)}: ${current}/${amount}</div>`;\n          }\n          if (reqs.needsPill && reqs.pillId) {\n            const current = app.state.resources[reqs.pillId] ?? 0;\n            const met = current >= reqs.pillCount;\n            reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req ${met ? 'met' : 'unmet'}\">${met ? '✓' : '✗'} ${getResourceName(reqs.pillId)}: ${current}/${reqs.pillCount}</div>`;\n          }\n          reqsEl.innerHTML += `<div class=\"breakthrough-req\" style=\"color:#aaa\">成功率: ${Math.floor(reqs.successRate * 100)}%</div>`;\n\n          const canAttempt = reqs.canAttempt &&\n            Object.entries(reqs.resourceCost).every(([r, a]) => (app.state.resources[r] ?? 0) >= a) &&\n            (!reqs.needsPill || (app.state.resources[reqs.pillId ?? ''] ?? 0) >= (reqs.pillCount ?? 0));\n\n          btnEl.disabled = !canAttempt;\n        } else {\n          reqsEl.innerHTML = `<div class=\"breakthrough-req\" style=\"color:#888\">修为满级后可突破</div>`;\n          btnEl.disabled = true;\n        }\n      });\n    }\n\n    // === Inventory panel ===\n    function renderInventory() {\n      const pillList = document.getElementById('pill-list');\n      const pills = app.getInventoryPills();\n\n      if (pills.length === 0) {\n        pillList.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#888\">暂无丹药</div>';\n        return;\n      }\n\n      pillList.innerHTML = '';\n      for (const pill of pills) {\n        const item = document.createElement('div');\n        item.className = 'pill-item';\n        item.innerHTML = `\n          <span style=\"color:${pill.color}\">💊</span>\n          <span class=\"pill-name\">${pill.name}</span>\n          <span class=\"pill-count\">×${pill.count}</span>\n          <button class=\"pill-use-btn\" data-id=\"${pill.id}\">服用</button>\n          ${pill.count > 1 ? `<button class=\"pill-use-all-btn\" data-id=\"${pill.id}\">全部</button>` : ''}\n        `;\n        pillList.appendChild(item);\n      }\n\n      // Bind pill use buttons\n      pillList.querySelectorAll('.pill-use-btn').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.addEventListener('click', () => app.usePillAction(btn.dataset.id));\n      });\n      pillList.querySelectorAll('.pill-use-all-btn').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.addEventListener('click', () => app.useAllPills(btn.dataset.id));\n      });\n    }\n\n    // === Alchemy status ===\n    function renderAlchemyStatus() {\n      const statusEl = document.getElementById('alchemy-status');\n      const session = app.state.alchemySession;\n\n      if (!session) {\n        statusEl.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\">选择配方开始炼丹</div>';\n        return;\n      }\n\n      const progress = Math.floor(session.progress * 100);\n      statusEl.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#ff8c32\">${session.recipeId === 'pill_juling' ? '聚灵丹' : session.recipeId === 'pill_peiyuan' ? '培元丹' : '凝气丹'}</div>\n        <div class=\"alchemy-progress\">\n          <div class=\"alchemy-progress-fill\" style=\"width:${progress}%\"></div>\n          <div class=\"alchemy-progress-text\">${progress}%</div>\n        </div>\n        ${session.complete ? '<button class=\"alchemy-collect-btn\" id=\"btn-collect-alchemy\">收取丹药</button>' : ''}\n      `;\n\n      const collectBtn = document.getElementById('btn-collect-alchemy');\n      if (collectBtn) {\n        collectBtn.addEventListener('click', () => app.collectAlchemyAction());\n      }\n    }\n\n    // === Building info ===\n    function updateBuildingInfo(building) {\n      const infoDiv = document.getElementById('building-info');\n      if (!building) {\n        infoDiv.innerHTML = '<div class=\"info-entry\">点击建筑查看详情</div>';\n        return;\n      }\n      const def = app.buildingDefs.get(building.buildingId);\n      if (!def) return;\n      const prod = def.production;\n      infoDiv.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"info-entry\" style=\"color:#ffd700;font-weight:bold\">${def.name}</div>\n        <div class=\"info-entry\">等级: ${building.level}/${def.maxLevel}</div>\n        <div class=\"info-entry\">类型: ${prod.mode === 'manual' ? '手动' : '自动'}</div>\n        <div class=\"info-entry\">产出: ${getResourceName(prod.resource)} ×${prod.amount}</div>\n        ${prod.interval > 0 ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">间隔: ${(prod.interval / 1000).toFixed(1)}s</div>` : ''}\n        ${prod.input ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">消耗: ${Object.entries(prod.input).map(([r,c]) => `${getResourceName(r)}:${c}`).join(' ')}</div>` : ''}\n        <div class=\"info-entry\">状态: ${building.isProducing ? '生产中' : '空闲'}</div>\n        ${building.progress > 0 ? `<div class=\"info-entry\">进度: ${Math.floor(building.progress * 100)}%</div>` : ''}\n      `;\n    }\n\n    // === State change handler ===\n    app.onStateChange = (state) => {\n      renderBuildingList();\n      renderRecipeList();\n      renderRealmPanel();\n      renderInventory();\n      renderAlchemyStatus();\n    };\n\n    app.onBuildingSelect = (building) => {\n      // Switch to info tab\n      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));\n      document.querySelector('[data-tab=\"info\"]').classList.add('active');\n      document.getElementById('tab-info').classList.add('active');\n      updateBuildingInfo(building);\n    };\n\n    app.onAlchemyUpdate = (session) => {\n      renderAlchemyStatus();\n    };\n\n    // === Breakthrough ===\n    document.getElementById('btn-breakthrough').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      app.attemptBreakthroughAction();\n    });\n\n    // === Toolbar buttons ===\n    document.getElementById('btn-save').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      import('./src/game/GameState.ts').then(({ saveGame }) => {\n        saveGame(app.state);\n        app.addNotification('游戏已保存', 'info');\n      });\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('btn-center').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      app.centerCamera();\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('btn-reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (confirm('确定要重置游戏进度吗？此操作不可撤销！')) {\n        import('./src/game/GameState.ts').then(({ clearSave }) => {\n          clearSave();\n          location.reload();\n        });\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Audio toggle\n    import('./src/game/AudioManager.ts').then(({ audioManager }) => {\n      const audioBtn = document.getElementById('btn-audio');\n      audioBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        audioManager.init();\n        const muted = audioManager.toggleMute();\n        audioBtn.textContent = muted ? '🔇' : '🔊';\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Initial render\n    renderRealmPanel();\n    renderInventory();\n    renderAlchemyStatus();\n    renderRecipeList();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","numLines":658,"startLine":1,"totalLines":658}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_65b6833aa83c4c65ae904703","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n3\t  \"regions\": [\n4\t    {\n5\t      \"id\": \"liqi_flat\",\n6\t      \"name\": \"炼气坪\",\n7\t      \"nameEn\": \"Qi Refining Flat\",\n8\t      \"width\": 20,\n9\t      \"height\": 15,\n10\t      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_1\",\n11\t      \"maxBuildings\": 20,\n12\t      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_stone\", \"spirit_grass\"],\n13\t      \"terrainBase\": \"grass\",\n14\t      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#2a3a1a\", \"grid\": \"#3a4a2a\" }\n15\t    },\n16\t    {\n17\t      \"id\": \"spirit_field_area\",\n18\t      \"name\": \"灵田区\",\n19\t      \"nameEn\": \"Spirit Field Area\",\n20\t      \"width\": 25,\n21\t      \"height\": 20,\n22\t      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_5\",\n23\t      \"maxBuildings\": 35,\n24\t      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_grass\"],\n25\t      \"terrainBase\": \"rich_soil\",\n26\t      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#1a3a1a\", \"grid\": \"#2a4a2a\" }\n27\t    },\n28\t    {\n29\t      \"id\": \"mine_area\",\n30\t      \"name\": \"灵石矿区\",\n31\t      \"nameEn\": \"Spirit Stone Mine\",\n32\t      \"width\": 30,\n33\t      \"height\": 20,\n34\t      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_8\",\n35\t      \"maxBuildings\": 40,\n36\t      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_stone\"],\n37\t      \"terrainBase\": \"rock\",\n38\t      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#2a2a3a\", \"grid\": \"#3a3a4a\" }\n39\t    }\n40\t  ]\n41\t}\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0e01ba0-5708-46af-9590-e43af2395006","uuid":"90ac2d0b-b1a4-4af3-ad94-94b48e06cc66","timestamp":"2026-05-23T01:35:20.950Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\game-projects\\steam-cultivation-factory\\src\\data\\regions.json","content":"{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"regions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"liqi_flat\",\n      \"name\": \"炼气坪\",\n      \"nameEn\": \"Qi Refining Flat\",\n      \"width\": 20,\n      \"height\": 15,\n      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_1\",\n      \"maxBuildings\": 20,\n      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_stone\", \"spirit_grass\"],\n      \"terrainBase\": \"grass\",\n      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#2a3a1a\", \"grid\": \"#3a4a2a\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"spirit_field_area\",\n      \"name\": \"灵田区\",\n      \"nameEn\": \"Spirit Field Area\",\n      \"width\": 25,\n      \"height\": 20,\n      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_5\",\n      \"maxBuildings\": 35,\n      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_grass\"],\n      \"terrainBase\": \"rich_soil\",\n      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#1a3a1a\", \"grid\": \"#2a4a2a\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mine_area\",\n      \"name\": \"灵石矿区\",\n      \"nameEn\": \"Spirit Stone Mine\",\n      \"width\": 30,\n      \"height\": 20,\n      \"unlockRealm\": \"liqi_8\",\n      \"maxBuildings\": 40,\n      \"specialResources\": [\"spirit_stone\"],\n      \"terrainBase\": \"rock\",\n      \"color\": { \"bg\": \"#2a2a3a\", \"grid\": \"#3a3a4a\" }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260523093523a1eb7ee777374fb7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the codebase. Let me plan the M3 implementation:\n\nTask #33: M3：筑基+金丹 — 传送带、傀儡分拣、多区域地图\n\nDeliverables:\n1. ConveyorBelt.ts - Lv1直线/Lv2转弯分叉灵脉通道系统\n2. Puppet.ts - 自动分类灵草到丹炉的傀儡分拣\n3. 多区域地图 - 筑基台/药王谷解锁\n4. 筑基期11-25级+金丹期26-45级境界扩展\n5. 新建筑: 灵田自动/灵脉井/丹炉自动/精炼炉\n6. 基础灵符条件触发\n7. 新丹方: 筑基丹/金丹引\n8. 版本0.3.0\n\nLet me create task items and start implementing. I'll create the files one by one.\n\nLet me plan this out:\n\n1. **ConveyorBelt.ts** - Conveyor belt system with pathfinding\n2. **Puppet.ts** - Puppet/sorter AI for auto-classifying items\n3. **Talisman.ts** - Basic talisman/condition trigger system\n4. Update **Cultivation.ts** - Add 筑基 11-25 levels and 金丹 26-45 levels\n5. Update **Alchemy.ts** - Add 筑基丹 and 金丹引 recipes\n6. Update **Inventory.ts** - Add new pill defs\n7. Update **buildings.json** - Add new M3 buildings (自动灵田, 灵脉井, 自动丹炉, 精炼炉, 灵脉通道Lv1/Lv2, 分拣傀儡, 基础灵符, 传送阵)\n8. Update **regions.json** - Add 筑基台 and 药王谷 regions\n9. Update **GameState.ts** - Version to 0.3.0, new resource types\n10. Update **App.ts** - Multi-region support, conveyor/puppet integration\n11. Update **Renderer.ts** - Render conveyors and puppets\n12. Update **Map.ts** - Multi-region terrain generation\n13. Update **index.html** - Region switcher UI, new building categories\n\nLet me start implementing. This is a big task so I'll create all files.\n\nLet me begin writing the code. I'll start with the core new systems first.\n\nFor the Conveyor Belt system:\n- Lv1: Straight line only\n- Lv2: Can turn and branch\n- Items travel along the belt from source to destination\n- Each belt segment is a 1x1 building that connects to adjacent segments\n\nFor the Puppet system:\n- Sorter puppets that stand at belt junctions\n- They route items based on type to different destinations\n- Auto-classify spirit grass to furnaces\n\nFor the Talisman system:\n- Basic condition triggers\n- Example: if spirit_grass > 10, stop auto-field\n- Conditions based on resource thresholds\n\nLet me write this code now. I'll focus on making it functional and integrable with the existing codebase.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c0e01ba0-5708-46af-9590-e43af2395006","uuid":"36fe7ff3-4b52-4289-862b-aa813003f0eb"}
